From ed04216dc468f9880dea0651c813b5762c401488 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mike Kinney <mike.kinney@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 17:37:45 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 3/6] fix(post): seat WinMax cycles at the section hop

Cancel active cycles before movement between holes. Pin safe seating and missing-hop refusal after cycles, probing, feeds, and arcs. Use the required Camcraft vendor value.

Keep simulator acceptance pending.

Refs #2573
